{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An angry little girl against the rest of her home village:</strong> Frieda\u2019s done being underestimated\u2014and she\u2019s going to find out what happened to her missing sister, whether everyone else likes it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a spooky point &amp; click adventure full of emotional twists, strange glances, and people with unclear intentions. Decide who\u2019s a friend\u2014and who\u2019s a liar with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question the villagers, uncover clues tucked away in conversations and puzzles. Poke around in the messy past everyone wishes would stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention, choose your words wisely (or don\u2019t), and connect the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But be aware: time is ticking and the next full moon is close...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/defa96d8887de668aba72e6341d954cd.poster.avif?t=1753446785\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/defa96d8887de668aba72e6341d954cd.webp?t=1753446785\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=253 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Rausching, an isolated island village full of weird stares and locked doors. Being the mayor\u2019s daughter opens some of them\u2014and gets a few slammed in your face.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/ce81289df1412cc4c013afa04959f2e3.poster.avif?t=1753446785\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/ce81289df1412cc4c013afa04959f2e3.apng?t=1753446785\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=253 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crack codes, shove clues together until they make sense, and use everything\u2014items, intuition, and your attitude\u2014to stay one step ahead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/0baef33c95c850053b289b66487d1d95.poster.avif?t=1753446785\" width=616 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/0baef33c95c850053b289b66487d1d95.webm?t=1753446785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The night your sister disappeared is as messy as your room. But by digging through other people\u2019s memories (whether they like it or not), you might just put the pieces together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/4af8eaf1ff5378c80b9b5b193090a80b.poster.avif?t=1753446785\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/4af8eaf1ff5378c80b9b5b193090a80b.apng?t=1753446785\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=253 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter. They change how people treat you\u2014and where this story goes. Play nice and smile through the nonsense? Or finally say what\u2019s really on your mind?</strong><br><strong> </strong><br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/extras/b6e6afba33d25ab6da3b5751299705be.avif?t=1753446785\" width=616 height=171 /></span>   </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802730?t=1753446785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/b52da89b1b61a14f483ce49b6093e3821061960a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753446785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/fa9c8bcde4af55fa9b9043b12b91bf2975e0b05e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753446785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802730/fa9c8bcde4af55fa9b9043b12b91bf2975e0b05e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753446785","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3851920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An angry little girl against the rest of her home village:</strong> Frieda\u2019s done being underestimated\u2014and she\u2019s going to find out what happened to her missing sister, whether everyone else likes it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a spooky point &amp; click adventure full of emotional twists, strange glances, and people with unclear intentions. Decide who\u2019s a friend\u2014and who\u2019s a liar with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question the villagers, uncover clues tucked away in conversations and puzzles. Poke around in the messy past everyone wishes would stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\